WEBVTT

00:29:58.163 --> 00:30:01.329
Research shows that when we consider
our responsibilities to others,

00:30:01.579 --> 00:30:03.204
we're less prone to escalation.

00:30:03.996 --> 00:30:07.329
Shifting attention away from our
own egos and images and toward

00:30:07.329 --> 00:30:10.538
the greater good can allow us to
make a more balanced assessment

00:30:12.038 --> 00:30:14.329
to free people from ego
and image concerns.

00:30:14.621 --> 00:30:17.954
Organizations need to think differently
about incentives to

00:30:18.746 --> 00:30:19.746
make failure acceptable.

00:30:19.788 --> 00:30:22.996
So even though the project
hasn't worked out,

00:30:23.079 --> 00:30:29.538
if the person has been very diligent in
looking at what the best prospects were,